msgstr " RÉŻKA "

#: kwritemain.cpp:273
msgid "Open File"
msgstr "Òtemkni lopk"

#: kwritemain.cpp:288
msgid ""
"The file given could not be read; check whether it exists or is readable for "
"the current user."
msgstr ""
"Nen lopk ni mòże òstac òtemkłi. Proszã sprôłdzë, czë nen lopk dô ë czë môsz "
"dosc prawa przëstãpù do niegò."

